---
const tools = ['HTML', 'CSS', 'JavaScript', 'Tailwind CSS', 'React', 'Next.js', 'TypeScript', 'Vite', 'Java', 'Supabase', 'Docker'];
---

<section id="stack" class="screen">
	<div class="wrap stack-layout">
		<div class="section-head reveal">
			<p class="eyebrow">02 / Ferramentas &amp; tecnologias</p>
			<h2>Tecnologias</h2>
			<p>No front-end uso React, Next.js, TypeScript, Vite e Tailwind CSS. No back-end trabalho com Node.js, Express, Prisma, PostgreSQL e SQLite, e também com Python e FastAPI. No Android uso Kotlin e Jetpack Compose. Para autenticação, dados e arquivos uso o Supabase. Também tenho experiência com Java e Docker.</p>
		</div>
		<ul class="tech-list reveal">
			{
				tools.map((tool, index) => (
					<li class="tech">
						<span class="tech-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
						{tool}
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>
		<div class="section-foot reveal">
			<a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/gustaaxz" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Veja meu GitHub ↗</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.stack-layout {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 56px;
	}

	.tech-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 12px;
	}

	.tech {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
		padding: 12px 18px;
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-size: 15px;
		color: var(--text);
		transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease), border-color 0.3s;
	}

	.tech:hover {
		transform: translateY(-3px);
		border-color: var(--sage);
	}

	.tech-index {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 11px;
		color: var(--terracotta);
	}

	.section-foot {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 20px;
	}
</style>
